{"from":"1:1","body":"<p><ref to=\"JOL.1.1\">1</ref> Joel, declaring sundry judgments of God, exhorts to observe them,<br/><ref to=\"JOL.1.8\">8</ref> and to mourn.<br/><ref to=\"JOL.1.14\">14</ref> He prescribes a solemn fast to deprecate those judgments.<br/><br/><br/>word.<br/><ref to=\"JER.1.2 EZK.1.3 HOS.1.1 2PE.1.21\">Jer 1:2; Eze 1:3; Ho 1:1; 2Pe 1:21</ref><br/>to.<br/><ref to=\"ACT.2.16\">Ac 2:16</ref></p>"}
